[{"id":"fastapi-0141-custom-route-boundary","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["APIRoute","Request"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十四)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十四)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/f8ac9084/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十四)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十四)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/f8ac9084/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>自定义 \u003ccode>APIRoute\u003c/code> 何时值得使用？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>当多个路由需要统一的协议级计时、媒体类型或原始请求处理时使用；业务参数、身份和权限仍放在依赖与处理函数中。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>APIRoute 可以包住最终 handler，适合记录耗时、在解析前拒绝错误 Content-Type 或统一回程头。它不应承载数据库会话和角色规则，否则测试、OpenAPI 和组合边界都会变得隐式。每个成功、异常和流式响应都要验证 route class 没有重复读 body、吞掉异常或遗漏清理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-object-is-eq","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","对象模型","is","相等性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>is\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>==\u003c/code> 的区别是什么？什么时候应该写 \u003ccode>is None\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>==\u003c/code> 比较值，\u003ccode>is\u003c/code> 比较是否为同一对象；缺失值判断应写 \u003ccode>value is None\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>==\u003c/code> 会调用对象的相等性协议，\u003ccode>is\u003c/code> 只问两个名称是否指向同一对象：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">left = [\u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">right = [\u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(left == right)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># True：内容相同\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(left \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> right)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># False：两个列表对象\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">value = \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(value \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># True：None 的单例判断\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>短字符串和小整数有时被实现复用，但那是优化，不是业务契约。\u003ccode>None\u003c/code> 是语言明确提供的单例，所以缺失值判断应使用 \u003ccode>is None\u003c/code>，不要用 \u003ccode>== None\u003c/code> 或依赖对象缓存。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-container-copy","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","浅拷贝","深拷贝","共享引用"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>浅拷贝和深拷贝的差别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>浅拷贝只新建外层容器，内层对象继续共享；深拷贝递归复制可复制的内部对象。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>浅拷贝只复制第一层，嵌套对象仍共享；深拷贝才会继续复制可复制的子对象：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> copy\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">source = [[\u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>], [\u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>]]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">shallow = source.copy()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">deep = copy.deepcopy(source)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">source[\u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>].append(\u003cspan class=\"number\">9\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(shallow)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [[1, 9], [2]]：共享内层列表\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(deep)     \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [[1], [2]]：内层也已复制\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>list.copy()\u003c/code>、切片和 \u003ccode>dict.copy()\u003c/code> 都是浅拷贝。深拷贝可能复制大量对象、破坏共享语义或无法处理外部资源；先明确所有权，必要时用不可变结构或显式转换，不要把 \u003ccode>deepcopy\u003c/code> 当成通用修复。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a8-dns-tools","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["DNS","dig"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>dig、host 和 nslookup 如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>dig 适合详细记录与调试，host 适合快速查询，nslookup 主要用于兼容性排查。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三者的定位粒度不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>工具\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>更适合\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>记录什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>dig\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>详细调试与工单证据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查询类型、服务器、TTL、状态和权威段\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>host\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>快速确认地址\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>名称与简短结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>nslookup\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>兼容旧环境\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>交互式查询和基本响应\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>应用可能绕过系统解析，使用缓存、DoH 或自带 resolver。记录工具、服务器和时间点，才能把“DNS 服务器返回 NXDOMAIN”与“应用仍在使用旧缓存”区分开。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]